        "Key Concepts, Terminology & Principles",
        "Business Impact of Cybersecurity"
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Cybersecurity Strategy & Governance",
      "id": "2",
      "points": [
        "Cybersecurity Governance: Roles, Responsibilities & Structures",
