        "Cybersecurity Policy, Standards & Controls",
        "Board-Level Cyber Oversight"
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Risk Management & Compliance",
      "id": "3",
      "points": [
        "Cyber Risk Management Frameworks",
        "Third-Party and Supply Chain Risk",
        "Compliance Landscape",
        "Internal Audit & Cyber Maturity Assessments"
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Cyber Crisis Leadership & Incident Response",
      "id": "4",
      "points": [
        "Incident Response Planning",
        "Communicating During a Cyber Crisis",
        "Lessons from High-Profile Breaches",
        "Post-Breach Recovery & Resilience"
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Emerging Threats & Technologies",
      "id": "5",
      "points": [
        "Understanding Emerging Threats",
        "Technology & Innovation in Cybersecurity"
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": " AI & GenAI for CyberSecurity",
      "id": "6",
      "points": [
        "AI-Driven Cyber Threats",
        "Leveraging AI for Cyber Defense"
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Capstone Project",
      "special": "1",
      "id": "capstone-product",
      "points": [
        "Develop a comprehensive cybersecurity strategy for a simulated organization, conduct a detailed risk assessment, identify vulnerabilities, and propose mitigation measures. Create a board-level report outlining business impact, compliance alignment, budget considerations, and an incident response plan. Ensure the strategy addresses emerging threats, regulatory requirements, and long-term resilience to safeguard critical assets and maintain operational continuity."
      ]
    }
